sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User Browser
    participant Proxy as Nginx Proxy Manager
    participant Portal as Homelab Portal (FastAPI)
    participant Auth as Authentik (10.0.10.20)

    User->>Proxy: GET https://portal.homelab.local/
    Proxy->>Auth: Validate Session (Forward Auth)
    alt Session is invalid / not logged in
        Auth-->>Proxy: Unauthorized (Redirect to auth.homelab.local)
        Proxy-->>User: HTTP 302 Redirect to Authentik Login
        User->>Auth: Authenticate Credentials
        Auth-->>User: Set session cookies & Redirect to portal
    end
    Auth-->>Proxy: Session Valid (Headers: X-Authentik-*)
    Proxy->>Portal: Forward Request with Session Cookies
    Portal->>Auth: GET /api/v3/core/applications/ (Forwarding User Cookies)
    Auth-->>Portal: List of Authorized Applications for user context
    Portal-->>User: Render Portal page with filtered applications grid

